"""Curated descriptions for members whose C++ header has no usable comment, and Python-flavored class docs.

Keys:  'Class.Method'                      every overload of a method
       'Class.Method(p: T, q: U)'          one overload (Python parameter names and types, as in the signatures)
       'Class.Field' / 'Class.Constant'    a field or constant
       'class:Class' / 'enum:Enum'         class or enumeration description (a string or a list of Markdown blocks)
"""

